066800     MOVE YEAR-PARM               TO YEAR-H2B.
066900     ADD 1                        TO PAGE-CNT.
067000     MOVE PAGE-CNT                TO PAGE-H2.
067100     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEADER1 AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE.
067200     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEADER2 AFTER ADVANCING 1.
067300     MOVE 2                       TO LINE-CNT.
067400
067500 751-PRINT-HEADINGS.
067600     WRITE PRT-REC FROM AST-LINE AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
067700     WRITE PRT-REC FROM MATERIAL-HDG  AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
067800     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEADER4 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
067900     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEADER5 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
